{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"创世记","commonName":"创世记","title":"创世记","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"10a45bcf2ede9deb41605171c53170d502fcae5c3b35e4565dec7e08e91d0387","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1531},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["人类的邪恶"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["当时，人类在地上开始逐渐增多，生了女儿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["上帝的儿子们",{"noteId":5},"看见人的女儿漂亮，就随意选来做妻子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华说：“人既然是血肉之躯，我的灵不会永远住在人的里面，然而人还可以活一百二十年。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["从上帝的儿子和人的女儿交合生子起，地上出现了巨人，他们是上古英武有名的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华看见人在地上罪恶深重，心里终日思想的都是恶事，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["就后悔在地上造了人，心里伤痛，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["说：“我要把所造的人，连同一切飞禽走兽和爬虫从地上都毁灭，因为我后悔造了他们。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["只有挪亚在耶和华面前蒙恩。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝命挪亚造方舟"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["以下是有关挪亚的记载。 挪亚是个义人，在当时的世代是个纯全无过的人，他与上帝同行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["挪亚生了三个儿子：闪、含和雅弗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["那时大地在上帝眼中败坏了，充满了暴行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["上帝看见大地败坏了，因为世人都行为败坏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["祂对挪亚说：“我决定消灭世人，因为他们使大地充满暴行。我要把他们和大地一起毁灭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["你要为自己用歌斐木建造一艘方舟，里面要有舱房，内外都要涂上柏油。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你建造的方舟要长一百三十五米，宽二十二米半，高十三米半。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["舟顶要有四十五厘米高的透光口，门开在方舟的侧面，整艘方舟要分为上、中、下三层。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["看啊，我要使洪水在地上泛滥，毁灭天下一切有生命气息的活物，地上的一切都要灭亡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["但我要和你立约，你与妻子、儿子和儿媳都可以进方舟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["每样动物你要带两只进方舟，雌雄各一只，好保存它们的生命。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["各类飞禽走兽和爬虫每样一对都要到你那里，好保全生命。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["你要为自己和这些动物预备各种食物，贮存起来。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["挪亚就照着上帝的吩咐把事情都办好了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"“上帝的儿子们”可能指塞特的后代，天使或有权势的人。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}